			description: [
				"Farmer's Delight knives harvest straw and turn ingredients into useful cuts. JEI shows which foods can be processed on a cutting board."
				"Farmer's Delight is a chain from soil to pantry to cutting board to heat. Use JEI's recipe category view to identify the workstation, tool, heat source, and serving container involved in each dish."
				"The knife gathers some ingredients more efficiently and the cutting board transforms inputs placed upon it. Hold the shown tool, interact with the board, and inspect JEI if an apparently correct ingredient does nothing."
