		{
			description: [
				"Place a Cutting Board, Cooking Pot and nearby pantry together. JEI reveals which knife, heat source and container each recipe expects, while visible shelves make missing ingredients obvious."
				"Cook meals for effects and saturation rather than hoarding raw ingredients forever. Store a simple travel food separately from expensive celebration meals."
				"A good homestead turns exploration loot into comfort: mushrooms become stew, fish become meals, and odd crops become reasons to build a market or dining hall."
