			description: [
				"Serene Seasons changes when many crops grow efficiently. Watch foliage and crop behaviour, diversify what you plant, and keep seed reserves instead of using the last harvest."
				"Store one season of food before expanding livestock. Mixed fields, orchards, fishing and preserved meals are safer than depending on a single enormous crop."
