		{
			description: [
				"Farmer's Delight cutting recipes happen in the world: place an ingredient on the Cutting Board and use the tool category shown by JEI. Knives portion food; axes and other tools can handle their own recipes."
				"Outputs slide from the board, so leave collection space or use a deliberate hopper or Create integration. Test valuable ingredients manually before automating them."
				"Keep knives on a nearby rack and label the preparation station. A kitchen teaches faster when the correct tool is visible beside the board."
				"Farmer's Delight is a chain from soil to pantry to cutting board to heat. Use JEI's recipe category view to identify the workstation, tool, heat source, and serving container involved in each dish."
