				"Farmer's Delight turns mixed organic material into Organic Compost, which matures into Rich Soil under the right conditions. Rich Soil supports stronger farming and additional blocks such as farmland variants."
				"Keep the compost area separate from food output and check JEI for valid ingredients. Use surplus crops and by-products rather than consuming the pantry's last meal."
